=== crlf, width 80, default
A dense mix

Intro with code, bold, italic, strike, link (https://example.com), [image: img]
(https://example.com/i.png) and html.

  // highlighted
  pub fn main() { println!("hi {}", 1 + 2); }

  plain colored block
  	with a tab

  {"a": [1, 2, {"b": null}], "c": "d"}

  key: value
  list:
    - one

┌─────┬───┐
│  a  │ b │
├─────┼───┤
│ x|y │ z │
└─────┴───┘

• one

    fenced in item
• two

1. ☑ done with code
2. ☐ open with a link (https://example.com)

│ quote
│ 
│ │ nested
│ │ 
│ │ │ deeper

Final paragraph ending with a hard break
and a trailing line.
